---
// Callout for Nova — the trading copilot powering research surfaced on this site.
---

<section class="border-y border-bone/5 bg-ink-900">
  <div class="container-wide grid gap-12 py-24 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Built in public</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-display-lg uppercase tracking-tight">
        Powered by <span class="text-signal">Nova</span>.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-bone-dim">
        Nova is the trading copilot we built for our own desk — a screener, a scorer,
        and an explainer that runs on real fundamentals, real smart-money flows, and a real
        philosophy: <em class="text-bone">quality × discount × smart-money confirmation.</em>
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-bone-dim">
        Every signal posted in the Discord is shaped by the same engine that picks our own positions.
        We open-source the thinking behind it — read the Nova dev blog as we ship.
      </p>
      <a href="/blog?category=nova-dev" class="btn-secondary mt-8">Read the Nova dev blog</a>
    </div>

    <div class="relative">
      <div class="aspect-square rounded-2xl border border-signal/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-signal/5 to-pulse/5 p-8">
        <div class="grid h-full grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          {['Quality', 'Discount', 'Smart Money', 'Conviction'].map((label, i) => (
            <div class="card flex flex-col justify-between" style={`animation-delay: ${i * 0.4}s`}>
              <p class="eyebrow">Layer {i + 1}</p>
              <p class="font-display text-3xl uppercase tracking-tight text-bone">{label}</p>
              <div class="h-1 w-full rounded-full bg-ink-700">
                <div
                  class="h-full rounded-full bg-signal"
                  style={`width: ${[78, 64, 82, 71][i]}%`}
                ></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
